What I wanted to emphasize WRT the Plane of Water is that you never
know the relative distance to the portal. So, as opposed to, say,
the Plane of Fire, where you can "scan" the whole level statically,
on Water you never know whether you are close to the portal or still
far away, thus potentially requiring too many charges, more than you
have.

That said, there are of course "combined solutions" for the problem,
that can accelerate the process and save charges of the wand of SDD,
if you take advantage of The Amulet's properties and only zap the
wand of SDD when the worn Amulet gives you strong hints.

